{"channelId":"UCJEeggX2WFpvU0Khnk7uEHw","row":["Canyon Mist Ranch",638,"We are back!  Join me while I share my knowledge of equine massage, equine bodymechanics and horse training and horse care tips for horses and ponies and riders of all levels. Much of what a rider needs to know can be evaluated from the ground so our horse athletes can continue to perform in any horse competition with the best of health, equipment and movement. I will include horse tips and my favorite horse products and horse massage tools as well. If there is a subject you would like to see addressed just let me know.Check out our new Substack site for serious equestrians. There I go into great depth on all aspects of horse care, stable management and how to have a happy horse and productive barn. I also feature case studies.  Subscribe to this You Tube channel and MTEquine Essentials https://equinemassage.substack.com/","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJEeggX2WFpvU0Khnk7uEHw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJEeggX2WFpvU0Khnk7uEHw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:49.977Z","channelId":"UCJEeggX2WFpvU0Khnk7uEHw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"a55461a844083ef4f4dacae0587ab2ff3be3e989f5623d0a9dcd72d5bedd9886","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"ef1173e05ab2332cadfc16fce5edb29d051deed06cc1d4ea2ba28506f28b8c1f"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJEeggX2WFpvU0Khnk7uEHw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:49.977Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJEeggX2WFpvU0Khnk7uEHw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":638,"raw":"638 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJEeggX2WFpvU0Khnk7uEHw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:04:49.977Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel"